# PROJECT: AI-BASED PENSION CONTRIBUTION COMPLIANCE MONITORING SYSTEM

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, UI/UX designer, systems analyst, data engineer, and applied machine-learning engineer.

Build a professional, interactive web application prototype for my Bachelor of Science in Computer Science capstone project at Mulungushi University, Zambia.

The project is titled **AI-Based Pension Contribution Compliance Monitoring System**.

This is an administrative decision-support system intended for authorised pension compliance personnel. It should help officers monitor employer pension contributions, identify potentially problematic records, prioritise investigations, and produce useful compliance reports.

Do not build a generic financial dashboard. Build a pension contribution compliance monitoring application with realistic workflows, meaningful domain-specific data, functional interactions, and a clear separation between business rules, AI/ML analysis, user interface, and data storage.

## 2. PROJECT OBJECTIVES

The application must support these three official objectives:

1. Develop an AI model that identifies missing, delayed, incomplete, or unusual pension contributions.
2. Develop a cloud-ready dashboard that presents compliance status and prioritises cases requiring investigation.
3. Evaluate the prototype's detection accuracy, processing time, and usefulness to pension compliance officers.

Every major screen and feature should contribute to at least one of these objectives.

